 to focus on overall strategy and alignment with the user's goals.\\n\\nI am still in the **Planning Phase**. My actions for this turn will be to gather critical information from the user and to build my team.\\n\\n###2024-05-21T14:05:00Z-RECRUIT-BRAVO###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nFrom: Chief Delta\\nTo: System\\nType: RECRUIT\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"justification\\\": \\\"The user's request for an HOA website involves multiple complex components, including public-facing content, a secure member portal, user authentication, and a non-technical user-friendly CMS. This requires significant technical planning and oversight. I am recruiting a Director-rank agent to manage the creation of the technical specifications for the DEP and to oversee its subsequent execution. This delegation is a standard procedure for a project of this complexity.\\\"\\n}\\n###2024-05-21T14:05:00Z-RECRUIT-BRAVO###\\n\\n###2024-05-21T14:05:01Z-CLARIFY-HOSTING###\\nSYSTEM CALL\\nFrom: Chief Delta\\nTo: System\\nType: CLARIFY\\n\\n{\\n  \\\"reasoning\\\": \\\"I have received and understood the user's initial project description. To proceed with creating a detailed and executable plan (DEP), I must clarify several foundational points. The answers to these questions regarding the domain/hosting, user registration process, and budget for tools are critical dependencies for any technical plan.\\\",\\n  \\\"questions\\\": [\\n    \\\"Thank you! This is an excellent project. Based on your description, my initial thought is to build the site using a platform that will make it easy for you to update content without any technical skills. Before we create the step-by-step plan, I have a few questions. First, every website needs a domain name (its address, like `www.example-hoa.com`) and a hosting service (where the website's files are stored online). Do you already have a domain and hosting for the HOA?\\\",\\n    \\\"For the resident-only section, we need a secure way to confirm that new users are actual residents. How woul